# LF in the repository, native line endings on checkout, except where a tool cares:
# shell scripts and Dockerfiles run inside Linux containers and on the VPS, so they
# must be LF everywhere; Windows batch files stay CRLF.
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
gradlew text eol=lf
Dockerfile* text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jar binary
*.tflite binary
